IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mra-practice`

-- Medical Registration Act 1997, ss 13 to 17 and 62 to 67 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_mra.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a registered doctor with a current certificate` MEANS Doctor WITH
    `is registered` IS TRUE
    `has a valid practising certificate` IS TRUE
    `is suspended` IS FALSE
    `is a ship's surgeon treating crew or passengers on board` IS FALSE

